            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "زندانی (zendâni) ها صبح آزاد شدند. Zendâni-hâ sobh âzâd shodand. The prisoners were released in the morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present âzâd mishavad. Âzâd kardan is \"to set free\"."
